./docs/articles/expensify-classic/expensify-card/Dispute-A-Transaction.md:7:- Unauthorized transaction activity
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/expensify-card/Dispute-A-Transaction.md:8:- Incorrect transaction amounts.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/expensify-card/Dispute-A-Transaction.md:9:- Duplicate charges for a single transaction.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/expensify-card/Dispute-A-Transaction.md:15:If you notice a transaction error on your Expensify Card, contact us immediately at concierge@expensify.com. We will ask a few questions to understand the situation better, and file a dispute with our card processor on your behalf.
